Question 1
Find the department-wise average salary, display only departments whose average salary is greater than 50,000, and sort the result from highest average salary to lowes

SELECT d.dept_name, AVG(e.salary)
    -> FROM employees e
    -> JOIN departments d
    -> ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id
    -> GROUP BY d.dept_name
    -> HAVING AVG(salary) > 50000
    -> ORDER BY AVG(salary) Desc;
+-----------+---------------+
| dept_name | AVG(e.salary) |
+-----------+---------------+
| FINANCE   |    55000.0000 |
